{"name":"Cliffside Park","hex":"#6f8165","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Cliffside Park","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A borough in Bergen County, New Jersey, United States."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Cliffside_Park"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cliffside Park, New Jersey","blocks":[{"text":"Cliffside Park is a borough in Bergen County, in the U.S. state of New Jersey. As of the 2020 United States census, the borough's population was 25,693, an increase of 2,099 (+8.9%) from the 2010 census count of 23,594, which in turn reflected an increase of 587 (+2.6%) from the 23,007 counted in the 2000 census."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Trinity_Episcopal_Church%2C_Cliffside_Park%2C_NJ_2009_jeh.jpg/330px-Trinity_Episcopal_Church%2C_Cliffside_Park%2C_NJ_2009_jeh.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cliffside_Park%2C_New_Jersey"},{"title":"Park","blocks":[{"text":"A park is an area of natural, semi-natural or planted space set aside for human enjoyment and recreation or for the protection of wildlife or natural habitats. Urban parks are green spaces set aside for recreation inside towns and cities. National parks and country parks are green spaces used for recreation in the countryside. State parks and provincial parks are administered by sub-national government states and agencies. Parks may consist of grassy areas, rocks, soil and trees, but may also contain buildings and other artifacts such as monuments, fountains or playground structures. Many parks have fields for playing sports such as baseball and football, and paved areas for games such as basketball. Many parks have trails for walking, biking and other activities. Some parks are built adjacent to bodies of water or watercourses and may comprise a beach or boat dock area. Urban parks often have benches for sitting and may contain picnic tables and barbecue grills."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Halleyparknovember_b_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Halleyparknovember_b_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Park"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/fa/Cliffside_Park%2C_New_Jersey_Seal.png/120px-Cliffside_Park%2C_New_Jersey_Seal.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/fa/Cliffside_Park%2C_New_Jersey_Seal.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/fa/Cliffside_Park%2C_New_Jersey_Seal.png/120px-Cliffside_Park%2C_New_Jersey_Seal.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACliffside_Park%2C_New_Jersey_Seal.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Palisades_Amusement_Park_7a.JPG/500px-Palisades_Amusement_Park_7a.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Palisades_Amusement_Park_7a.JPG/500px-Palisades_Amusement_Park_7a.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Highrises atop Hudson Palisades","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APalisades_Amusement_Park_7a.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Cliffside_Pk_Epiphany_RCC_jeh.JPG/500px-Cliffside_Pk_Epiphany_RCC_jeh.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/30/Cliffside_Pk_Epiphany_RCC_jeh.JPG/1280px-Cliffside_Pk_Epiphany_RCC_jeh.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commo